@host = http://localhost:5090

### Create a short link
POST {{host}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://thecodeman.net"
}

### Create — INVALID url (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "not-a-url"
}

### Follow a short link (replace CODE with the one you got above)
GET {{host}}/CODE

### Stats for a code
GET {{host}}/api/stats/CODE

### Rate limit demo: send this 6+ times fast -> the 6th returns 429
POST {{host}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com"
}
